$FG,5$STARTING POINT$FG$
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Recommended order:
  1. sh.ZC      - Everything needs shell scripts
  2. make.ZC   - Build system
  3. sed.ZC    - Configure scripts need it
  4. pthread.ZC - Threading (Go needs this)
  5. Continue from there...

$FG,2$Let's begin with the shell interpreter.$FG$
